Claude Code / Claude DesktopopencodeAny other client <p><code>.mcp.json</code> in your project, <code>~/.claude.json</code> for every project, or <code>claude_desktop_config.json</code> for Claude Desktop:</p> <pre><code>{
  "mcpServers": {
    "ailoud": { "command": "ailoud", "args": ["mcp"] }
  }
}
</code></pre> <p><code>opencode.jsonc</code>:</p> <pre><code>{
  "mcp": {
    "ailoud": {
      "type": "local",
      "command": ["ailoud", "mcp"],
      "enabled": true
    }
  }
}
</code></pre> <p>Run <code>ailoud mcp</code> and speak MCP over stdio.</p> <p>Check it works:</p> <pre><code>echo '{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"method":"initialize","params":{"protocolVersion":"2025-06-18","capabilities":{},"clientInfo":{"name":"probe","version":"1"}}}' | ailoud mcp
</code></pre> <p>It serves the same library the CLI uses, in both directions.</p>
